      "created_at": "2022-08-17T02:25:24.299Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Citizen Dawn attempts to fill the power vacuum on Dok’Thorath! It’s up to Xtreme Prime Warden Captain Cosmic, Ra, and Benchmark to foil her plans! Challenge mode: she burns the highest hero for 3 upon Citizen destruction. Luckily, Ra knows a thing or two about burning as well!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3\" title=\"20220816221810_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20220816221810_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"GJ7VAkSZPq6nc9zvj9CJLCFZe3\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04d478b18f3b42ef00ead479fc7f21547f0128d3_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20220816221810_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 336 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Not really bad. Got one Aurora out of the way quickly, and never flipped despite the environment taking out Citizens. Kill it with fire, etc., etc. 'Nuff said.</p>",
