      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/c68b51/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-08-17T13:29:55.743Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint.  I had flesh of the sun god but I didn’t need it.  She never even got to flip we just burned her down, literally.  I imagine this being Dawn: “By the power of the sun i will burn you all”  Ra: “Powered by the sun? ha. I am the Sun”<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539\" title=\"Screenshot_2022-08-17-09-23-19\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539_2_281x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_2022-08-17-09-23-19\" data-base62-sha1=\"gQy4PcUt2t4VDyRprWgLypIyPVf\" width=\"281\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539_2_281x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539_2_421x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539_2_562x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/76137af428ff0406c8b6f66e1584df462b6e7539_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_2022-08-17-09-23-19</span><span class=\"informations\">1440×2560 240 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
