    {
      "id": 247368,
      "name": "",
      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-08-18T10:59:40.527Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb\" title=\"Screenshot_20220817-175904\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220817-175904\" data-base62-sha1=\"likzrIO4roLm0pFKllyEtWSIRSj\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/954024f3f8c3e64ce7a4011cf0744b0cdf2c8efb_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220817-175904</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 94.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>The capital of DokThorath is apparently named Curbstomp City.  Imbued Fire on a Missile Pod sounds like it would be rather unwise, but doubling all of Benchmark’s plinks made for a pretty devastating salvo.  As usual though I got very little satisfaction from playing my favorite version of Captain Cosmic, as I couldn’t build up a proper barrage of cannon.  I must remember to try him against someone like Apostate sometime.</p>",
