      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-08-18T13:36:14.972Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hard to amass a large group of 4-HP Constructs (or Citizens for that matter) when the environment just runs amok. I think I knocked out a Ravager or two just so they wouldn’t be wiping the board. Seems like it would take some extra plays and redirection to get a really good Xtreme cosmic energy gun barrage going. I still found him fairly effective once everyone switched to blasting fire.</p>",
